Source: akari-archive-keyring
Section: misc
Priority: important
Maintainer: Akari OS <packages@lucya.systems>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), gnupg
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Homepage: https://lucya.systems
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: akari-archive-keyring
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: OpenPGP key of the Akari OS package archive
 The key apt checks Akari OS's packages with. Sources name it with
 Signed-By: /usr/share/keyrings/akari-archive-keyring.gpg, so it vouches for
 Akari's archive only, never for Debian's.
